			"Message": "Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Sky into Current",
			"SHA": "44b539eee117d166cf1a2d7cb069635914c84a34"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-19T21:40:58Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				142,
				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Sky): Normalize comment punctuation in InstallEditorAndOutput\n\nReplace em dashes (`—`) with regular hyphens (`-`) in JSDoc-style inline comments for the `sky://editor/diff` handler. The em dashes were inconsistent with the rest of the codebase's comment conventions, which use ASCII punctuation exclusively.\n\nNo functional change — the comment block describes the same payload contract for the `vscode.diff`/`$scm:openDiff` effect arm.",
			"SHA": "5459b35eac20fd9b74cf1344a9fdf6f486a80b09"
		}
